{
  "slug": "clawket",
  "name": "Clawket",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "LLM-native work management plugin for Claude Code. 10 lifecycle hooks auto-track your entire workflow — PreToolUse blocks code changes unless a task is registered.\n\nIncludes 6 dashboard views (Kanban, Timeline, Wiki, Backlog, Plans, Summary), sub-agent task binding, and auto-cascade completion. All data stored locally in SQLite.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**, **7 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `clawket-dashboard` (Use when checking work status, starting or finishing tasks, or creating tasks in the Clawket work board), `clawket-defect-fix` (Use when a verification round reports defect rows — register a fix task per defect under the defect-resolution…), `clawket-plan-design` (Use when designing a Clawket Plan + Units from authored scenarios — pins the Done proposition, decomposes scenarios…), `clawket-scenario-author` (Use when authoring atomic user scenarios for a new domain or menu area — produces per-domain spec knowledge…), `clawket-scenario-refine` (Use when a verification round reports scenario_error rows — decide atomic-split / intent-redefinition / deletion for each scenario,…), `clawket-verify-batch` (Use during a verification round to dispatch sub-agent batches that reason scenarios against code, emit per-batch TSV evidence,…), `clawket-verify-loop` (Use to run a verification round end-to-end — dispatch sub-agent batches, collect 7-field TSV evidence, transcribe into Clawket…)\n- **Hooks** (7): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `SubagentStart`, `SubagentStop`, `Stop`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `clawket`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install clawket@claude-community` from `Seungwoo321/clawket`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
